  m_text: '1. Explore the area and locate the emergency exit.

    2. Choose an extinguisher
    that matches the fire.

    3. Remove the safety pin.

    4. Aim at the base
    of the fire.

    5. Squeeze the lever and sweep side to side.

    6. Follow
    the exit marker after extinguishing the fire.'
